{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-013":{"renderings":[{"id":"0f5c82d936c26b43","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Indicates a parallel or matching situation; 'if Noun1 is (truly) Noun1, then Noun2 is also Noun2'."},{"id":"d4c1b42fdd92fe33","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"This structure conveys a comparison: 'If Noun1 is indeed that kind of thing (Noun1), then naturally Noun2 is also that kind of thing (Noun2)'. It’s often used to show parallels or equivalences in a rhetorical way."},{"id":"7865b6e7445fc98b","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Noun1 + が + (repeat Noun1) + なら、Noun2 + も + (repeat Noun2) + だ"},{"id":"c6497de2d1a6473f","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Noun が Noun なら: when X is like that, of course Y is too (親が親なら)."},{"id":"494013f68287c276","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"parallel"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Like X, Like Y (Both Alike)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"parallel"}}]},"n1-013#c193bc0611ef":{"renderings":[{"id":"c23bd9b9b52bcc72","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If demons are indeed demons, humans are likewise humans."}]},"n1-013#908b482e5fe8":{"renderings":[{"id":"17a19920c62f4e49","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If he is the president, then I'm the president too."}]},"n1-013#d2e9b72090d3":{"renderings":[{"id":"559d5e397512abfb","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If you're a warrior, then I'm a warrior as well."}]},"n1-013#1522d0431120":{"renderings":[{"id":"350ea8493413c7ff","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-013"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"If a hamster counts as a pet, then a cat is also a pet."}]}}}